    "title": "San Fernando Police Identify Driver in Fatal New Year's Day Accident - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gabriel Arizon, San Fernando Valley Sun/El Sol ,\n23 minutes ago The San Fernando Police Department (SFPD) have identified the driver involved in a fatal accident in the early morning hours on New Year’s Day. Matthew Alexander Gonzalez, 31, of Granada Hills was killed in a car accident that occurred near the intersection of 4th Street and Park Avenue in the City of San Fernando around 5:45 a.m. SFPD Chief Fabian Valdez previously told the San Fernando Valley Sun/el Sol that the driver hit a utility pole and spun out of control. He was pronounced dead at the scene. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
